    {
      "id": "g029",
      "type": "group",
      "label": "ESP32 RESTRICTIONS — honoured, do not forget",
      "x": -100,
      "y": 60,
      "width": 1200,
      "height": 180,
      "color": "#1d3557"
    },
    {
      "id": "t030",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "**Reserved / never attach**\nGPIO1/3 USB serial · GPIO25/26 loopback-only",
      "x": -70,
      "y": 100,
      "width": 540,
      "height": 120,
      "color": "#1d3557"
    },
    {
      "id": "t031",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "**Avoid for peripherals**\nstraps 0/2/5/12/15 · flash 6–11 · 34–39 never outputs",
      "x": 500,
      "y": 100,
      "width": 540,
      "height": 120,
      "color": "#1d3557"
    },
    {
      "id": "g032",
      "type": "group",
      "label": "R307S AS ACTUALLY WIRED  —  owner-reported, not measured",
      "x": -100,
      "y": 280,
      "width": 1200,
      "height": 460,
      "color": "#b91c1c"
    },
    {
      "id": "t033",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "**1 red**\nESP32 VIN\n[voltage not measured]",
      "x": -70,
      "y": 330,
      "width": 175,
      "height": 170,
      "color": "#b91c1c"
    },
    {
      "id": "t034",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "**2 black**\nESP32 GND\n[assembled per report]",
      "x": 125,
      "y": 330,
      "width": 175,
      "height": 170,
      "color": "#b91c1c"
    },
    {
      "id": "t035",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "**3 yellow**\nGPIO32 RX\n(sensor TX)\n[no valid response]",
      "x": 320,
      "y": 330,
      "width": 175,
      "height": 170,
      "color": "#b91c1c"
    },
    {
      "id": "t036",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "**4 green**\nGPIO33 TX\n(sensor RX)\n[no valid response]",
      "x": 515,
      "y": 330,
      "width": 175,
      "height": 170,
      "color": "#b91c1c"
    },
    {
      "id": "t037",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "**5 blue**\nopen,\ninsulated\n[leave open]",
      "x": 710,
      "y": 330,
      "width": 175,
      "height": 170,
      "color": "#525252"
    },
    {
      "id": "t038",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "**6 white**\nopen,\ninsulated\n[leave open]",
      "x": 905,
      "y": 330,
      "width": 175,
      "height": 170,
      "color": "#525252"
    },
    {
      "id": "t039",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "### Wire colour is an observation, not proof of the PCB pad function\n**3.3 V solder jumper**: open = pin 1 feeds the LDO (5 V expected) · shorted = LDO bypassed, pin 1 must be 3.3 V.\n**5 V into a shorted jumper kills the module silently** — the leading unmeasured suspect, and invisible to software.",
      "x": -100,
      "y": 530,
      "width": 1200,
      "height": 180,
      "color": "#92400e"
    },
